From: FocusLamp local maintenance patch
Subject: [LOCAL C5] Ordinary MCP delayed-result diagnostic, 0/3000 ms only

Requires components/mcp_delayed_probe and manager registration.
Base: existing local dependency tree before 2026-10-27 probe changes, not clean upstream.
